      "finding_type": "intelligence",
      "summary": "Systematic patent extraction pipeline: 24 US patents transferred to Russia/Cyprus entities across 3 portfolio companies",
      "detail": "Pipeline confirmed at: (1) Spectralus: 8 laser patents to OOO Spectralus (2015), (2) Centice: 7 Raman spectroscopy patents via Readsboro strict foreclosure to ASB International Services Cyprus (2016-2021), (3) Nano-Optic Devices: 9 optical computing patents to OOO Nanooptic Devices (2016). Oscrivia Limited (Cyprus HE176751, director Aleksei Kirpu) used as lending vehicle to take security interests. Vladimir Yakushev (S-Group Managing Partner) chairs all Russian receiving entities. Centice received NIH SBIR funding. Innolume, ADT, FiberZone checked -- no extraction pattern found at those companies.",
