    {
      "id": 9246,
      "finding_type": "identity",
      "summary": "S-Group Capital describes itself as managing financial assets for Mordashov; Gabidullin and Yakushev both MIPT + INSEAD graduates recruited as partners in 2007",
      "detail": "S-Group Capital Management Limited was founded in 2007 in Moscow. It describes itself as managing 'financial assets of private investors headed by Mr. Alexei A. Mordashov, the majority shareholder and CEO of OAO Severstal and ZAO Severgroup.' Managing Partner Vladimir Yakushev and Partner Aidar Gabidullin both graduated from Moscow Institute of Physics and Technology (MIPT) and hold INSEAD MBA degrees, suggesting coordinated recruitment. Yakushev was formerly executive director of Severstal-Resource. The firm invested in US/European technology companies (Centice, Spectralus, Advanced Diamond Technologies, FiberZone, Innolume, Nano Optic Devices) and is now listed as 'no longer investing.'",
